summary:
  A hunt question goes out to an address on the listener's own network.

history:
  Refusing the answer afterwards is not enough: the request itself is the
  knock. The address is judged before anything leaves the machine.

target:
  package/contents/ui/KinHunt.qml

find:
          if (host === "" || HostGuard.isPrivateHost(host)) {

replace:
          if (host === "") {

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_kinhunt.qml::test_one_question_reports_what_it_saw.
  Line-neutral.
